3. She enjoyed playing harmless pranks on coworkers by changing their computer wallpapers. (Verbatim: "what i would do is set set a wallpaper to like something kind of normal looking one that's like you know not too suspicious and then after like i don't know five or ten minutes have it changed to like something really weird")

4. She has a current VTuber model that cost thousands of dollars. (Verbatim: "this current model cost thousands you want me to go back to 60 buckaroo model no it's not happening")

5. She previously had a cheaper VTuber model that cost around $60. (Verbatim: "you want me to go back to 60 buckaroo model no it's not happening")

